# Current Company verification journey after shared registration.
# Run auth.http for signup, sign-in and explicitly requested account-email proof.
# Use company-setup.http for complete multipart submission and rejected correction.
# Separate employer signup, phone OTP, provisional saves, standalone uploads and JSON-only
# Company submission/correction are retired with HTTP 410. No unfinished form is saved.
# Use company-membership.http for invitations and membership actions.
# Run only the desired Staff approval OR rejection path against disposable local data.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerToken = REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@staffToken = REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@expectedVersion = REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_COMPANY_VERSION

### Current Company identity and suspension state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Owner feedback and version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/verification
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Owner immutable submission/decision history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/me/verification/history
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Staff history; workspace selection cannot grant this authority
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/companies/{{companyId}}/verification-history
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
X-Guardian-Portal: staff

### Staff approval of a pending dossier
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/companies/{{companyId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
X-Guardian-Portal: staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "VERIFIED",
  "expectedVersion": {{expectedVersion}}
}

### Alternative rejection; correct the same Company through company-setup.http afterward
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/companies/{{companyId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
X-Guardian-Portal: staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": {{expectedVersion}},
  "rejectionReason": "Giấy phép chưa rõ thông tin; vui lòng bổ sung bản hợp lệ."
}
